  "details": "In an instance with about around 40 - 80 people in most cases turning nameplates to \"hidden\" instead of standard can give me a 20fps boost.\n\nWhy is something so simple taking up that much performance on my computer?\n\nRTX 5070ti 16gb, 64gb ram, Ryzen 7800x3d\n\nI play with MSAA on and off, still lags. Honestly shouldn't even be an issue with MSAA to begin with. Are you culling nameplates that are not visible or too far away to even read?\n\nAre you batching them in some way?\n\nPlease look into ways to optimize them further.",
